        "created_at": "2015-12-02T21:41:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm not sure if it's because I don't watch much baseball or not but what you've suggested above seems more confusing to me. &nbsp; I'm happy with what it is currently. &nbsp; My issue in the rulebook is that there are assumptions made but those did get clarified on the FAQ on BGG. &nbsp;</p>",
