        "raw": "<p>I&#39;m not sure if it&#39;s because I don&#39;t watch much baseball or not but what you&#39;ve suggested above seems more confusing to me. &nbsp; I&#39;m happy with what it is currently. &nbsp; My issue in the rulebook is that there are assumptions made but those did get clarified on the FAQ on BGG. &nbsp;</p>",
